---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title="COMPASS-31 questionnaire: free online version with automatic scoring"
			description="Complete the COMPASS-31 autonomic symptom questionnaire online for free. Get your weighted score immediately with a domain breakdown and interpretation guide. No sign-up required."
		/>
	<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "itemListElement": [
        {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://www.postviralrecovery.com/"},
        {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Tools", "item": "https://www.postviralrecovery.com/tools/"},
        {"@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": "COMPASS-31", "item": "https://www.postviralrecovery.com/tools/compass-31/"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is a normal COMPASS-31 score?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "In the original validation study, healthy controls scored a mean of approximately 5–7. A score above 16 is commonly cited as suggesting a meaningful autonomic symptom burden."}
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What does a high COMPASS-31 score mean?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "A high score reflects a greater self-reported burden of autonomic symptoms across the six domains measured. It is not a diagnosis of any condition. Scores should be discussed with your doctor or specialist."}
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is the COMPASS-31 used for POTS?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. The COMPASS-31 is widely used in POTS research and clinical practice to measure autonomic symptom burden. It has also been used in long COVID and ME/CFS research."}
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
</script>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<div class="tool-header">
				<a href="/tools" class="section-label tools">Tools</a>
				<h1>COMPASS-31</h1>
				<p class="subtitle">Composite Autonomic Symptom Score</p>
				<p class="description">
  The COMPASS-31 (Composite Autonomic Symptom Score) is a 31-item self-report questionnaire that measures the severity of autonomic symptoms across six domains: orthostatic intolerance, vasomotor function, secretomotor function, gastrointestinal symptoms, bladder function, and pupillomotor function. It was developed at the Mayo Clinic and published by Sletten and colleagues in 2012 as a shorter, more practical version of the original 169-item Autonomic Symptom Profile.
</p>
<p class="description">
  It is widely used in both clinical practice and research to screen for dysautonomia and to track autonomic symptom burden over time. It has been validated in multiple languages and is referenced in studies on POTS, diabetic neuropathy, and post-viral autonomic dysfunction including long COVID.
</p>
<p class="description">
  The questionnaire generates a weighted total score from 0 to 100, with higher scores indicating greater symptom severity. Each domain is scored separately and then weighted according to the original validation, so the total reflects the relative clinical importance of different symptom areas rather than simply adding up raw answers.
</p>
<p class="description">
  If you have a post-viral condition, POTS, ME/CFS, or suspected dysautonomia, the COMPASS-31 can help you quantify your symptom burden in a structured way. It is particularly useful for tracking changes over time and for bringing a concrete, standardised summary to clinical appointments.
</p>
<p class="description">
  This is a free, interactive version. Complete it below and receive your weighted score immediately, broken down by domain. No sign-up or email is required.
</p>
<div class="disclaimer">
  <strong>This is not a diagnostic tool.</strong> Your score reflects self-reported symptom severity and does not constitute a diagnosis of any condition. Scores should be discussed with your doctor or specialist. Based on: Sletten DM, Suarez GA, Low PA, Mandrekar J, Singer W. <em>COMPASS 31: a refined and abbreviated composite autonomic symptom score.</em> Mayo Clin Proc. 2012;87(12):1196–1201.
</div>
			</div>

			<form id="compass-form" novalidate>
				<!-- DOMAIN 1: Orthostatic Intolerance -->
				<fieldset class="domain" data-domain="orthostatic">
					<legend>
						<span class="domain-number">Domain 1</span>
						<span class="domain-name">Orthostatic intolerance</span>
					</legend>
					<p class="domain-intro">Symptoms that occur when standing up or remaining upright: such as dizziness, faintness, visual changes, palpitations, or weakness of the legs.</p>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">1. When standing for prolonged periods or rising quickly, do you experience symptoms such as dizziness, faintness, lightheadedness, visual blurring, palpitations, tremulousness, or weakness of the legs?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="0" required> <span>Never</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="1"> <span>Mild: occasionally, doesn't limit activity</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="2"> <span>Moderate: frequently, mildly limits activity</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="3"> <span>Severe: frequently, significantly limits activity</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="4"> <span>Very severe: constantly present, prevents normal activity</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">2. When these orthostatic symptoms occur, do they improve promptly upon sitting down or lying flat?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="0" required> <span>Not applicable (I don't have these symptoms)</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="1"> <span>Rarely improves</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="2"> <span>Sometimes improves</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="3"> <span>Usually improves</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="4"> <span>Always improves immediately</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">3. Have you fainted (lost consciousness) in the past year?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="0" required> <span>No</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q3" value="4"> <span>Yes</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">4. If you have fainted in the past year, approximately how many times?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="0" required> <span>Not applicable / none</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="1"> <span>1 time</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="2"> <span>2–4 times</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="3"> <span>5–10 times</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q4" value="4"> <span>More than 10 times</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>
				</fieldset>

				<!-- DOMAIN 2: Vasomotor -->
				<fieldset class="domain" data-domain="vasomotor">
					<legend>
						<span class="domain-number">Domain 2</span>
						<span class="domain-name">Vasomotor</span>
					</legend>
					<p class="domain-intro">Symptoms related to temperature regulation and sweating.</p>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">5. Do you experience heat intolerance: unusual discomfort, worsening of symptoms, or inability to tolerate warm environments?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="0" required> <span>Never</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="1"> <span>Mild</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="2"> <span>Moderate</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="3"> <span>Severe</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q5" value="4"> <span>Very severe</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">6. Have you noticed decreased sweating in your feet or legs compared to what it used to be?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="0" required> <span>No change</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="1"> <span>Mildly decreased</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="2"> <span>Moderately decreased</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="3"> <span>Markedly decreased</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q6" value="4"> <span>Absent / no sweating in these areas</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">7. Have you noticed excessive or compensatory sweating in areas that still sweat normally (such as the face, head, or trunk)?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="0" required> <span>No</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="1"> <span>Mild</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="2"> <span>Moderate</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="3"> <span>Severe</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q7" value="4"> <span>Very severe: soaks clothing</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>
				</fieldset>

				<!-- DOMAIN 3: Secretomotor -->
				<fieldset class="domain" data-domain="secretomotor">
					<legend>
						<span class="domain-number">Domain 3</span>
						<span class="domain-name">Secretomotor</span>
					</legend>
					<p class="domain-intro">Symptoms related to dryness of the mouth, eyes, and throat.</p>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">8. Do you experience significant dryness of the mouth?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="0" required> <span>Never</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="1"> <span>Mild: occasionally dry</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="2"> <span>Moderate: frequently dry</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="3"> <span>Severe: constantly dry, need to sip water frequently</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q8" value="4"> <span>Very severe: interferes with eating and speaking</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">9. Do you experience significant dryness of the eyes?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q9" value="0" required> <span>Never</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q9" value="1"> <span>Mild</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q9" value="2"> <span>Moderate</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q9" value="3"> <span>Severe</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q9" value="4"> <span>Very severe: need eye drops constantly</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">10. Do you have difficulty swallowing because of a dry mouth or throat?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q10" value="0" required> <span>Never</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q10" value="1"> <span>Mild: occasionally</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q10" value="2"> <span>Moderate</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q10" value="3"> <span>Severe</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q10" value="4"> <span>Very severe</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">11. Do you experience significant dryness of the skin overall?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q11" value="0" required> <span>Never</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q11" value="1"> <span>Mild</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q11" value="2"> <span>Moderate</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q11" value="3"> <span>Severe</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q11" value="4"> <span>Very severe</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>
				</fieldset>

				<!-- DOMAIN 4: Gastrointestinal -->
				<fieldset class="domain" data-domain="gi">
					<legend>
						<span class="domain-number">Domain 4</span>
						<span class="domain-name">Gastrointestinal</span>
					</legend>
					<p class="domain-intro">Symptoms related to digestion and gut function. The autonomic nervous system plays a major role in gut motility.</p>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">12. Do you experience constipation (fewer than 3 bowel movements per week, or very hard/difficult stools)?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q12" value="0" required> <span>Never</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q12" value="1"> <span>Mild: occasionally</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q12" value="2"> <span>Moderate: frequently</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q12" value="3"> <span>Severe</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q12" value="4"> <span>Very severe: requires laxatives regularly</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">13. Do you experience diarrhoea?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q13" value="0" required> <span>Never</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q13" value="1"> <span>Mild: occasionally loose stools</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q13" value="2"> <span>Moderate</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q13" value="3"> <span>Severe</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q13" value="4"> <span>Very severe: incapacitating</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">14. Do you experience alternating constipation and diarrhoea?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q14" value="0" required> <span>Never</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q14" value="1"> <span>Occasionally</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q14" value="2"> <span>Frequently</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q14" value="3"> <span>Most of the time</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q14" value="4"> <span>Constantly</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">15. Do you experience nausea?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q15" value="0" required> <span>Never</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q15" value="1"> <span>Mild</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q15" value="2"> <span>Moderate</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q15" value="3"> <span>Severe</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q15" value="4"> <span>Very severe</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">16. Do you experience vomiting?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q16" value="0" required> <span>Never</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q16" value="1"> <span>Rarely</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q16" value="2"> <span>Sometimes</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q16" value="3"> <span>Often</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q16" value="4"> <span>Very often</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">17. Do you feel full unusually quickly when eating (early satiety)?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q17" value="0" required> <span>Never</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q17" value="1"> <span>Mild: occasionally</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q17" value="2"> <span>Moderate: frequently</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q17" value="3"> <span>Severe: unable to finish normal-sized meals</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q17" value="4"> <span>Very severe: very small portions only</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">18. Do you experience bloating or abdominal distension after meals?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q18" value="0" required> <span>Never</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q18" value="1"> <span>Mild</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q18" value="2"> <span>Moderate</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q18" value="3"> <span>Severe</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q18" value="4"> <span>Very severe</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">19. Do you experience difficulty swallowing solid food?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q19" value="0" required> <span>Never</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q19" value="1"> <span>Mild: occasionally</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q19" value="2"> <span>Moderate</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q19" value="3"> <span>Severe</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q19" value="4"> <span>Very severe: liquid diet only</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">20. Have you had unintentional weight loss of more than 5 kg in the past year?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q20" value="0" required> <span>No</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q20" value="2"> <span>Yes, 5–10 kg</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q20" value="4"> <span>Yes, more than 10 kg</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">21. Do you experience abdominal pain or cramping?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q21" value="0" required> <span>Never</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q21" value="1"> <span>Mild</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q21" value="2"> <span>Moderate</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q21" value="3"> <span>Severe</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q21" value="4"> <span>Very severe</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">22. Do you experience rectal urgency (sudden need to have a bowel movement with very little warning)?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q22" value="0" required> <span>Never</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q22" value="1"> <span>Rarely</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q22" value="2"> <span>Sometimes</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q22" value="3"> <span>Often</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q22" value="4"> <span>Constantly</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">23. Do you experience faecal incontinence?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q23" value="0" required> <span>Never</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q23" value="1"> <span>Rarely</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q23" value="2"> <span>Sometimes</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q23" value="3"> <span>Often</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q23" value="4"> <span>Frequently</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>
				</fieldset>

				<!-- DOMAIN 5: Bladder -->
				<fieldset class="domain" data-domain="bladder">
					<legend>
						<span class="domain-number">Domain 5</span>
						<span class="domain-name">Bladder</span>
					</legend>
					<p class="domain-intro">Urinary symptoms related to autonomic control of the bladder.</p>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">24. Do you experience urinary urgency or increased frequency of urination?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q24" value="0" required> <span>Never</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q24" value="1"> <span>Mild</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q24" value="2"> <span>Moderate</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q24" value="3"> <span>Severe</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q24" value="4"> <span>Very severe</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">25. Do you have difficulty starting urination or feel that your bladder doesn't empty completely?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q25" value="0" required> <span>Never</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q25" value="1"> <span>Mild</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q25" value="2"> <span>Moderate</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q25" value="3"> <span>Severe</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q25" value="4"> <span>Very severe: need to catheterise</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">26. Do you experience urinary incontinence (leakage of urine)?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q26" value="0" required> <span>Never</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q26" value="1"> <span>Rarely</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q26" value="2"> <span>Sometimes</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q26" value="3"> <span>Often</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q26" value="4"> <span>Constantly</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>
				</fieldset>

				<!-- DOMAIN 6: Pupillomotor -->
				<fieldset class="domain" data-domain="pupillomotor">
					<legend>
						<span class="domain-number">Domain 6</span>
						<span class="domain-name">Pupillomotor</span>
					</legend>
					<p class="domain-intro">Visual symptoms related to autonomic control of pupil size and light adaptation.</p>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">27. Do you have difficulty seeing clearly in low light or dim environments?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q27" value="0" required> <span>Never</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q27" value="1"> <span>Mild</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q27" value="2"> <span>Moderate</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q27" value="3"> <span>Severe</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q27" value="4"> <span>Very severe</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">28. Do your eyes take longer than usual to adjust when moving from bright to dark environments (dark adaptation)?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q28" value="0" required> <span>Never</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q28" value="1"> <span>Mild: slight delay</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q28" value="2"> <span>Moderate</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q28" value="3"> <span>Severe</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q28" value="4"> <span>Very severe: takes minutes to adjust</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">29. Do you experience blurred vision?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q29" value="0" required> <span>Never</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q29" value="1"> <span>Mild: occasionally</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q29" value="2"> <span>Moderate</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q29" value="3"> <span>Severe</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q29" value="4"> <span>Very severe: constantly blurred</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">30. Are you abnormally sensitive to bright light (photophobia)?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q30" value="0" required> <span>Never</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q30" value="1"> <span>Mild</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q30" value="2"> <span>Moderate</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q30" value="3"> <span>Severe</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q30" value="4"> <span>Very severe: need to wear sunglasses indoors</span></label>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="question">
						<p class="q-text">31. Do you experience pain, aching, or grittiness in or around the eyes?</p>
						<div class="options" data-max="4">
							<label><input type="radio" name="q31" value="0" required> <span>Never</span></label>
							<label><input type="radio" name="q31" value="1"> <span>Mild</span></label>
